# OpenWrt dropbear reads root's authorized keys from THIS file
# (/etc/dropbear/authorized_keys), NOT /root/.ssh/authorized_keys.
#
# This placeholder is overwritten at build time by the secrets overlay
# (openwrt-secrets, build.sh "Layer 3") — its files: entry MUST target
# path: etc/dropbear/authorized_keys. Without a real key baked in, the
# router boots with NO key-based SSH and Ansible (root over SSH) can't
# reach it. Add your key via: just secrets::edit secrets.yaml
#
# ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAI... user@host
